                snippet="Project ideas must be the original work of the participating team, must not have \npreviously won any similar competition, and must not be a fully developed \norganizational project. Each team is required to submit a signed Originality \nStatement bearing the Team Leader's signature affixed over an Indonesian \nRp10,000 stamp duty, which can be accessed via: Techtonic Work of Originality\u00a0\n\nEach team must submit the work within the specified deadline. Late submissions \nwill not be accepted, no deadline extensions will be granted, and failure to \nsubmit all required documents on time will result in disqualification.\u00a0\n\nThe judges' decision is final and cannot be contested.",
